# The agent-index usage client, pinned.
#
# Not committed: plow-pbc/agent-index-client owns that file and is public now,
# so this repo names a commit instead of carrying a copy that drifts from it.
# `just client` fetches exactly this revision and refuses anything else.
#
# A sha, never `main`. The same reason the Dockerfile pins its base by digest:
# a moving reference substitutes unreviewed code under an agent that holds a
# live credential. Bumping this is an edit somebody reviews.
#
# The checksum is the second half of that. A sha in a URL is only as good as
# the host serving it, and this file is executed inside the agent.
sha=435fea5ff49ced6db78a67e9a996a7d9fbde633f
sha256=45ad4efb7c6dd89a73b9f4e31782d85f9fbaad3a531804ec75f0618a3bd8603a
path=standalone/agent_index_client.py
